{"item_id":"feed:https://www.treelinereview.com/gearreviews/best-rain-gear-for-kids","version_id":"ba81a92eb4678d651e4b9c03d597595be346c7d518cbd26ead178e00ad48c82f","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, the testing concerns children's sizing, playground use, school days, and toddler rain suits rather than gear suitable for Mammoth competitors; references to adult equivalents do not establish adult performance. Commercial incentives applies to the disclosed affiliate commissions, although the article includes substantive hands-on testing.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.treelinereview.com/gearreviews/best-walking-shoes-men","version_id":"269805f4b18e128a306ef239975a5de1cdff96e6551ee3fa8a07d48fc2b86e9a","decision":"accept","reason":"Relevance, Credibility, and Suitability and official requirements support using the HOKA Transport 2 hiking tests across Colorado, the Northeast, and Michigan, including reported traction limits and an excessively narrow fit, to inform footwear trials for Mammoth. Under Commercial incentives and Uncertainty, disclose affiliate commissions and attribute these observations to one publisher; predominantly urban testing and absent loaded-ruck experience limit conclusions, supporting Pieces 02 and 03.","piece_ids":["02","03"]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.treelinereview.com/gearreviews/saucony-triumph-24-road-running-shoe-review","version_id":"0a185c2f72e172f484769c08c69312fb5564f957179e64da21f142daf0631ade","decision":"accept","reason":"Relevance, Credibility, and Freshness and novelty support the new midsole review's 50-plus miles of testing, including hot-weather breathability, occasional wet-surface grip, secure fit, and limited trail suitability, as evidence for Mammoth footwear tradeoffs in Pieces 01, 02, and 03. Under Commercial incentives and Uncertainty, disclose affiliate commissions and attribute findings to this single publisher; loaded-ruck performance and long-term durability remain untested, and projected lifespan is not a measured result.","piece_ids":["01","02","03"]}
